	| Country             | Canada                        | 2 |
	| City                | Vancouver                     | 2 |
	| State/Province      | British Columbia              | 2 |
	| Postal Code         | V5Y 0C9                       | 2 |
	| Primary             | true                          | 2 |
	| Dossiera Project    | ${staticDossieraProjectKey}   |   |
	| Salesforce Project  | ${staticSalesforceProjectKey} |   |
	When I click on the "History" tab
	Then the history entry with the keyword "Auto > Added Address" with the field value "Address" should be visible on the account details page with the following values
	| Update Description          | Auto > Added Address                                        |
	| Update Field Name           | Address                                                     |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A                                                         |
	| Update Field New Value      | 456 Fake Street Diamond Bar, California 91765 United States |
	And the history entry with the keyword "Koroneiki QA Service Producer > Added Address" with the field value "Address" should be visible on the account details page with the following values
	| Update Description          | Koroneiki QA Service Producer > Added Address              |
	| Update Field Name           | Address                                                    |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A                                                        |
	| Update Field New Value      | 456 Main Street Vancouver, British Columbia V5Y 0C9 Canada |

